          "type": "legal_section",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "ONE BAG REFUND GUARANTEE",
            "content": "<p>If your dog tried Yumwoof but did not like it, we offer a 21-day money-back guarantee on one bag from your first order to customers in the continental United States. Please note that this is only applicable to one (1) bag in your first order, so please keep that in mind if purchasing two (2+) or more bags for a dog who hasn't yet tried Yumwoof.</p><p>Over your 21-day initial trial period, if your picky eater won't eat the food we've recommended, our nutritionists will offer solutions we've created for picky eaters. We'll do everything we can to help your dog find a meal plan they love!</p><p>Shipping is non-refundable. If you are eligible for a refund, you will be refunded the entire cost of that bag less shipping.</p>"
          }
        },
        "legal_section_mrF4dX": {
          "type": "legal_section",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "CANCELING MID-SHIPMENT",
            "content": "<p>If an order with your first bag has already shipped and you need to cancel the order while it is on its way to you, we may accept a return of an unopened bag at our discretion less a $15 restocking fee**. Please note you will also be responsible for paying the return shipping cost.</p>"
          }
        },
        "legal_section_FVAqUm": {
          "type": "legal_section",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "CONTINENTAL UNITED STATES ONLY",
            "content": "<p>Items purchased from or delivered to Hawaii, Alaska, military base addresses, or anywhere outside of the continental United States are not eligible for returns. This limitation includes our One Bag Refund Guarantee.</p>"
          }
        },
        "legal_section_JBHUep": {
          "type": "legal_section",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "RETURNED PACKAGES",
            "content": "<p>If the mail carrier is unable to deliver your order after attempting to do so, and it is returned back to us, we will automatically refund your order upon receiving your package less a $15 restocking fee**.</p><p>** We wish we didn't have to charge restocking fees, but we are unfortunately charged fees by the mail carrier when this happens. We still lose money on these orders, even after the restocking fee.</p>"
